# Build context = repo root (docker build -f docker/cu128/Dockerfile.ycchen-opd .).
# The whole repo is COPYed into the image, so keep it — only drop VCS metadata, caches,
# local venvs, and run/output artifacts that must never leak into the image.
.git
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
**/venv
**/runs
**/wandb
**/outputs
**/*.log
